    [4906]={name="Rainwalker Boots",quality=1,ilvl=7,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Vision' - pick it over the other choices. In Mulgore.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Rite of Vision",lore="I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."},
    [4907]={name="Woodland Tunic",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Webwood Egg' - pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="Webwood Egg",lore="Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."},
    [4908]={name="Nomadic Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Continues' - pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Continues",lore="A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."},
    [4911]={name="Thick Bark Buckler",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Attack on Camp Narache'. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Attack on Camp Narache",lore="After carefully evaluating the map, you realize that what you discovered are the plans made by the Bristleback warchief for an extended siege on Camp Narache."},
    [4914]={name="Battleworn Leather Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cutting Teeth' - pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Cutting Teeth",lore="The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."},
    [4921]={name="Dust-covered Leggings",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Burning Blade Medallion' - pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4928]={name="Sandrunner Wristguards",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'From The Wreckage....' - pick it over the other choices. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4951]={name="Squealer's Belt",quality=1,ilvl=7,reqLevel=1,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from \"Squealer\" Thornmantle in Kalimdor.",zone="Kalimdor",npc="\"Squealer\" Thornmantle"},
    [4954]={name="Nomadic Belt",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Hunt Begins' - pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4962]={name="Double-layered Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=8,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gathering Leather' - pick it over the other choices. In Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Gathering Leather",lore="Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"},
    [4964]={name="Goblin Smasher",quality=2,ilvl=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Supervisor Fizsprocket' - pick it over the other choices. In Mulgore.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Supervisor Fizsprocket",lore="According to the documents you salvaged from the caravan, the Venture Co. created many plans to attempt to drive us from our lands here, so that they could have free reign to plunder our lands."},
    [5345]={name="Stonewood Hammer",quality=2,ilvl=14,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bracers' - pick it over the other choices. In The Barrens.",zone="The Barrens",questName="Centaur Bracers",lore="The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."},
    [5394]={name="Archery Training Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Balance of Nature' - pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="The Balance of Nature",lore="Greetings. I am Conservator Ilthalaine. My purpose in Shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained."},
    [5395]={name="Woodland Shield",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Webwood Egg' - pick it over the other choices. In Shadowglen.",zone="Shadowglen",questName="Webwood Egg",lore="Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."},
    [5581]={name="Smooth Walking Staff",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Stolen Journal' - pick it over the other choices. In Coldridge Valley.",zone="Coldridge Valley",questName="The Stolen Journal",lore="My journal! They took it away to the cave. The one that had it... It was a big brute with some odd markings on his skin and face. I didn't get a much better look than that."},
    [5591]={name="Rain-spotted Cape",quality=1,ilvl=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Enchanted Glade' - pick it over the other choices. In Teldrassil.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Enchanted Glade",lore="I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."},
    [5617]={name="Vagabond Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bashal'Aran' - pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Bashal'Aran",lore="It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."},
    [5777]={name="Brave's Axe",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rite of Strength' - pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Rite of Strength",lore="The Rites of the Earthmother are the steps a young tauren needs to take to gain respect in Thunder Bluff. First you must pass the Rite of Strength."},
    [5957]={name="Handstitched Leather Vest",quality=1,ilvl=8,reqLevel=3,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [6059]={name="Nomadic Vest",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Battleboars'. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Battleboars",lore="The Battleboars of Brambleblade Ravine to the east are encroaching on our tribal hunting grounds. They are trained to be malicious by the Bristleback Quilboars with whom we are at war."},
    [6070]={name="Wolfskin Bracers",quality=1,ilvl=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Wolves Across the Border' - pick it over the other choices. In Northshire Valley.",zone="Northshire Valley",questName="Wolves Across the Border",lore="I hate those nasty timber wolves! But I sure like eating wolf steaks... Bring me tough wolf meat and I will exchange it for something you'll find useful."},
